#
# Text files are stored with LF endings and checked out unchanged on every
# platform, so the repository contents are identical everywhere and the
# integrity checks in the tests are not affected by checkout settings.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.lobs binary
